{"seq":3,"slug":"tracking-error","title":"跟踪误差与基金评价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/index-fund-theory/tracking-error","wordCount":2409,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"跟踪误差与基金评价\">跟踪误差与基金评价</h1><blockquote>\n<p>跟踪偏差 vs 跟踪误差、成因分析（现金拖累、采样复制、再平衡）、评价指标体系（费率、税效、流动性）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>所有指数基金都声称&quot;复制指数&quot;，但复制质量由两个必须区分的量刻画：跟踪偏差（TD）衡量基金系统性跑输或跑赢了多少，理想值等于负费率；跟踪误差（TE）衡量这种偏离是否稳定可预测，是超额收益的标准差。前者是方向，后者是波动，把二者混为一谈就无法诊断一只基金究竟是&quot;费用高&quot;还是&quot;复制差&quot;。偏离的来源是现金拖累、采样复制、指数调仓与分红处理等结构性因素，因此评价一只指数基金要沿费率、跟踪质量、流动性、税效四个维度逐层打分，而不是只看历史收益率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要评价指数基金\">为什么需要评价指数基金</h2><p>所有指数基金都声称&quot;复制指数&quot;，但复制质量千差万别。一只年化跟踪误差 2% 的指数基金和一只 0.1% 的指数基金，10 年后的累计偏差可能相差数万元。学会评价指数基金的复制质量，是被动投资者的核心技能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跟踪偏差与跟踪误差\">跟踪偏差与跟踪误差</h2><p>这两个概念经常被混淆，但含义截然不同：</p>\n<h3 id=\"跟踪偏差-tracking-difference-td\">跟踪偏差（Tracking Difference, TD）</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TD = R_{fund} - R_{index}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>跟踪偏差是基金实际收益与基准指数收益的差值（通常为年化值）。它衡量的是<strong>方向性偏离</strong>——基金系统性地跑输（或跑赢）了多少。</p>\n<p><strong>理想值</strong>：等于负费率。如果一只 ETF 管理费+托管费为 0.2%，理想的 TD 为 -0.2%。</p>\n<h3 id=\"跟踪误差-tracking-error-te\">跟踪误差（Tracking Error, TE）</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TE = \\sigma(R_{fund} - R_{index}) = \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{T-1}\\sum_{t=1}^{T}(r_{fund,t} - r_{index,t} - \\overline{TD})^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.3232em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0561em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5.2832em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2832em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1.056em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.0161em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2832em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.742em;height:3.3632em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"3.3632em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 3363\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M702 80H40000040\nH742v3229l-4 4-4 4c-.667.7 -2 1.5-4 2.5s-4.167 1.833-6.5 2.5-5.5 1-9.5 1\nh-12l-28-84c-16.667-52-96.667 -294.333-240-727l-212 -643 -85 170\nc-4-3.333-8.333-7.667-13 -13l-13-13l77-155 77-156c66 199.333 139 419.667\n219 661 l218 661zM702 80H400000v40H742z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>跟踪误差是基金超额收益（相对于基准）的标准差。它衡量的是<strong>偏离的波动性</strong>——基金每天/每月的偏差是否稳定可预测。</p>\n<h3 id=\"两者的关系\">两者的关系</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[完美复制] --&gt;|TD ≈ -费率| B[系统性偏差小]&#10;    A --&gt;|TE ≈ 0| C[随机偏差小]&#10;    D[糟糕复制] --&gt;|TD ≫ 费率| E[系统性偏差大]&#10;    D --&gt;|TE 大| F[随机偏差大]\">graph TD\n    A[完美复制] --&gt;|TD ≈ -费率| B[系统性偏差小]\n    A --&gt;|TE ≈ 0| C[随机偏差小]\n    D[糟糕复制] --&gt;|TD ≫ 费率| E[系统性偏差大]\n    D --&gt;|TE 大| F[随机偏差大]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情况</th>\n<th>TD</th>\n<th>TE</th>\n<th>诊断</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>优质全复制</td>\n<td>≈-费率</td>\n<td>极小</td>\n<td>复制精确，成本透明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高费率全复制</td>\n<td>大负值</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>复制精确但费用拖累严重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低费率但失控</td>\n<td>不确定</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>复制质量差，偏差不可预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增强型指数</td>\n<td>可能正</td>\n<td>中-大</td>\n<td>有主动操作，背离被动本质</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"跟踪误差的成因分析\">跟踪误差的成因分析</h2><h3 id=\"1-现金拖累-cash-drag\">1. 现金拖累（Cash Drag）</h3><p>基金不可能将 100% 的资产投入股票——需要保留现金应对申赎、分红再投资、T+1 交割等。这些现金头寸获得的收益（通常接近零或货币市场利率）远低于股票收益，造成系统性拖累。</p>\n<p><strong>量化估算</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Cash Drag</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mtext>Cash Ratio</mtext><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cash Drag} \\approx \\text{Cash Ratio} \\times (R_{index} - R_{cash})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cash Drag</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cash Ratio</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>如果基金保持 2% 现金比例，指数年化收益 10%，货币利率 2%：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Cash Drag</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cash Drag} = 2\\% \\times (10\\% - 2\\%) = 0.16\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cash Drag</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2%</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.16%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在中国市场，由于 T+1 制度和申赎频繁，ETF 的现金拖累通常在 0.05%–0.3% 之间。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-采样复制-sampling-optimization\">2. 采样复制（Sampling/Optimization）</h3><p>当指数成分股数量庞大（如 MSCI ACWI 含 2900+ 只股票）或部分成分股流动性极差时，基金会采用&quot;优化采样&quot;而非完全复制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>复制方法</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>跟踪误差</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完全复制</td>\n<td>成分股少、流动性好</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层采样</td>\n<td>成分股多、市场广</td>\n<td>小-中</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化采样</td>\n<td>包含低流动性市场</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合成复制</td>\n<td>无法直接买入</td>\n<td>取决于对手方</td>\n<td>衍生品成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>分层采样的逻辑</strong>：将指数按行业、市值、国家等维度分层，从每层中选取代表性股票，使采样组合在各维度的暴露近似于完整指数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-再平衡与指数调仓\">3. 再平衡与指数调仓</h3><p>指数定期调整成分股（季度/半年度），基金需要在调仓日执行大量交易。这引发两类成本：</p>\n<p><strong>直接成本</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>买卖价差（Bid-Ask Spread）</li>\n<li>市场冲击成本（Market Impact）</li>\n<li>佣金</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>间接成本（&quot;指数前跑&quot;效应）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>调仓信息公开后，套利者提前买入即将纳入的股票、卖出即将剔除的股票</li>\n<li>基金被迫在不利价格执行交易</li>\n<li>研究估计每次再平衡导致 0.1%–0.3% 的隐性成本</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[指数公告调仓] --&gt; B[套利者前跑]&#10;    B --&gt; C[新纳入股价格上涨]&#10;    B --&gt; D[被剔除股价格下跌]&#10;    C --&gt; E[基金高价买入]&#10;    D --&gt; F[基金低价卖出]&#10;    E --&gt; G[跟踪成本增加]&#10;    F --&gt; G\">graph LR\n    A[指数公告调仓] --&gt; B[套利者前跑]\n    B --&gt; C[新纳入股价格上涨]\n    B --&gt; D[被剔除股价格下跌]\n    C --&gt; E[基金高价买入]\n    D --&gt; F[基金低价卖出]\n    E --&gt; G[跟踪成本增加]\n    F --&gt; G</pre><h3 id=\"4-分红处理\">4. 分红处理</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分红处理</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>对跟踪的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分红再投资</td>\n<td>分红当日自动买入</td>\n<td>最小偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分红发放</td>\n<td>现金分配给投资者</td>\n<td>与含分红指数产生偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分红税收</td>\n<td>预扣税影响净收益</td>\n<td>系统性负偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分红延迟</td>\n<td>从除权到实际到账有时滞</td>\n<td>短期跟踪误差增大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"5-证券出借收入\">5. 证券出借收入</h3><p>部分指数基金通过出借持有的股票获得额外收入（证券融出业务）。这可以部分抵消管理费用：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>净费率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>名义费率</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>证券出借收入</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{净费率} = \\text{名义费率} - \\text{证券出借收入}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">净费率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">名义费率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">证券出借收入</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在美国市场，大型 ETF（如 iShares）通过证券出借每年可获得 0.02%–0.10% 的额外收入。中国市场转融通业务也逐步为 ETF 提供类似收入来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指数基金综合评价体系\">指数基金综合评价体系</h2><h3 id=\"一级指标-费率\">一级指标：费率</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>费率类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>中国 ETF 典型范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>管理费率</td>\n<td>基金公司收取</td>\n<td>0.15%–0.50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>托管费率</td>\n<td>托管银行收取</td>\n<td>0.05%–0.10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易佣金</td>\n<td>券商收取（ETF 免印花税）</td>\n<td>0–万1.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐性成本</td>\n<td>买卖价差 + 冲击成本</td>\n<td>0.01%–0.20%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>2026 中国费率竞争格局</strong>：头部宽基 ETF 已降至管理费 0.15% + 托管费 0.05% 的行业最低档（如平安基金旗下 12 只 ETF），总费率仅 0.2%。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二级指标-跟踪质量\">二级指标：跟踪质量</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算</th>\n<th>判断标准（A 股 ETF）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>年化跟踪偏差</td>\n<td>年化基金收益-指数收益</td>\n<td>≤费率的 1.5 倍为优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>年化跟踪误差</td>\n<td>日超额收益的标准差×√252</td>\n<td>&lt;1% 为优, &lt;2% 为可接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大单日偏差</td>\n<td>max|日超额收益|</td>\n<td>&lt;0.5% 为优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息比率（负值）</td>\n<td>TD / TE</td>\n<td>越接近 0 越好</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三级指标-流动性\">三级指标：流动性</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>判断标准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日均成交额</td>\n<td>二级市场交易量</td>\n<td>&gt;1 亿元为高流动性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买卖价差</td>\n<td>最优买卖报价差/中间价</td>\n<td>&lt;0.1% 为优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折溢价率</td>\n<td>(市价-净值)/净值</td>\n<td>±0.1% 以内为优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>做市商数量</td>\n<td>报价做市商数量</td>\n<td>≥3 家为优</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"四级指标-税务效率\">四级指标：税务效率</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>中国 ETF 现状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资本利得税</td>\n<td>个人免征（目前政策）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分红税</td>\n<td>ETF 分红按持有期差别征税（≥1年免税）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>印花税</td>\n<td>ETF 交易免征（股票交易单边 0.05%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换手税效</td>\n<td>ETF 实物申赎机制天然规避资本利得触发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"综合评分卡示例\">综合评分卡示例</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 评价维度&#10;        F[费率 30%]&#10;        T[跟踪质量 30%]&#10;        L[流动性 25%]&#10;        X[税效 15%]&#10;    end&#10;    F --&gt; S[综合评分]&#10;    T --&gt; S&#10;    L --&gt; S&#10;    X --&gt; S\">graph TD\n    subgraph 评价维度\n        F[费率 30%]\n        T[跟踪质量 30%]\n        L[流动性 25%]\n        X[税效 15%]\n    end\n    F --&gt; S[综合评分]\n    T --&gt; S\n    L --&gt; S\n    X --&gt; S</pre><h2 id=\"中国主流宽基-etf-跟踪质量对比-2026-年数据\">中国主流宽基 ETF 跟踪质量对比（2026 年数据）</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ETF 名称</th>\n<th>管理费</th>\n<th>规模(亿元)</th>\n<th>年化 TE</th>\n<th>日均成交(亿元)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>华泰柏瑞沪深300 ETF</td>\n<td>0.15%</td>\n<td>~2000</td>\n<td>&lt;0.5%</td>\n<td>~100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>易方达沪深300 ETF</td>\n<td>0.15%</td>\n<td>~1500</td>\n<td>&lt;0.5%</td>\n<td>~60</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>南方中证500 ETF</td>\n<td>0.15%</td>\n<td>~600</td>\n<td>&lt;0.8%</td>\n<td>~30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>华夏中证1000 ETF</td>\n<td>0.20%</td>\n<td>~300</td>\n<td>&lt;1.0%</td>\n<td>~15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>华夏科创50 ETF</td>\n<td>0.50%</td>\n<td>~800</td>\n<td>&lt;1.0%</td>\n<td>~40</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注：数据为 2026 年 Q1 近似值，实际数据请以基金公告为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践选基流程\">实践选基流程</h2><p>对于个人投资者选择指数基金/ETF 的推荐流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    S1[确定目标指数] --&gt; S2[列出跟踪该指数的所有产品]&#10;    S2 --&gt; S3[按总费率排序&lt;br/&gt;剔除费率过高的]&#10;    S3 --&gt; S4[检查规模和流动性&lt;br/&gt;规模&lt;1亿或日成交&lt;1000万的剔除]&#10;    S4 --&gt; S5[对比跟踪偏差和跟踪误差&lt;br/&gt;取最近3年数据]&#10;    S5 --&gt; S6[考虑税效和分红方式]&#10;    S6 --&gt; S7[最终选择]\">graph TD\n    S1[确定目标指数] --&gt; S2[列出跟踪该指数的所有产品]\n    S2 --&gt; S3[按总费率排序&lt;br/&gt;剔除费率过高的]\n    S3 --&gt; S4[检查规模和流动性&lt;br/&gt;规模&lt;1亿或日成交&lt;1000万的剔除]\n    S4 --&gt; S5[对比跟踪偏差和跟踪误差&lt;br/&gt;取最近3年数据]\n    S5 --&gt; S6[考虑税效和分红方式]\n    S6 --&gt; S7[最终选择]</pre><h3 id=\"费率优先原则\">费率优先原则</h3><p>晨星（Morningstar）在多项研究中反复确认：<strong>费率是预测基金未来表现最可靠的单一指标</strong>。低费率基金未来跑赢同类的概率显著高于高费率基金。这一结论对被动基金尤其成立——因为被动基金的收益差异几乎完全由费率和跟踪质量决定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规模的门槛效应\">规模的门槛效应</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规模区间</th>\n<th>风险评估</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt;1 亿元</td>\n<td>高清盘风险，流动性差，应避免</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1-10 亿元</td>\n<td>可接受，但需关注趋势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10-100 亿元</td>\n<td>健康，流动性充足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt;100 亿元</td>\n<td>头部产品，流动性极佳，做市商充足</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"特殊场景-增强型指数基金\">特殊场景：增强型指数基金</h2><p>增强型指数基金（Enhanced Index Fund）在跟踪指数的基础上加入量化模型试图获取超额收益。评价时需注意：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>与纯被动的差异</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>跟踪误差</td>\n<td>通常在 3%–8%，远高于纯被动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>费率</td>\n<td>管理费 1.0%–1.5%，接近主动基金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超额收益</td>\n<td>部分产品在中国 A 股确实能持续创造超额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风格漂移</td>\n<td>可能隐性暴露某些因子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用投资者</td>\n<td>愿意承担更高跟踪风险以换取超额可能性的人</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>中国增强型指数基金市场较为活跃（2026 年规模约 3000 亿元），部分产品（如富国中证 500 增强、西部利得中证 500 增强）确实展现了持续的超额能力。但需注意：超额收益的持续性存疑，且增强策略本质上是主动管理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>关键洞见</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>跟踪偏差</td>\n<td>衡量系统性偏离方向，理想值等于负费率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跟踪误差</td>\n<td>衡量偏离的不可预测性，越小越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现金拖累</td>\n<td>保持现金头寸的机会成本，约 0.05%–0.3%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数前跑</td>\n<td>调仓信息公开引发的隐性交易成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>费率优先</td>\n<td>在同类产品中，费率是最可靠的选基单一指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流动性门槛</td>\n<td>规模 &lt;1 亿元的 ETF 存在清盘风险，应避免</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跟踪误差与基金评价","id":"跟踪误差与基金评价"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要评价指数基金","id":"为什么需要评价指数基金"},{"level":2,"text":"跟踪偏差与跟踪误差","id":"跟踪偏差与跟踪误差"},{"level":3,"text":"跟踪偏差（Tracking Difference, TD）","id":"跟踪偏差-tracking-difference-td"},{"level":3,"text":"跟踪误差（Tracking Error, TE）","id":"跟踪误差-tracking-error-te"},{"level":3,"text":"两者的关系","id":"两者的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"跟踪误差的成因分析","id":"跟踪误差的成因分析"},{"level":3,"text":"1. 现金拖累（Cash Drag）","id":"1-现金拖累-cash-drag"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 采样复制（Sampling/Optimization）","id":"2-采样复制-sampling-optimization"},{"level":3,"text":"3. 再平衡与指数调仓","id":"3-再平衡与指数调仓"},{"level":3,"text":"4. 分红处理","id":"4-分红处理"},{"level":3,"text":"5. 证券出借收入","id":"5-证券出借收入"},{"level":2,"text":"指数基金综合评价体系","id":"指数基金综合评价体系"},{"level":3,"text":"一级指标：费率","id":"一级指标-费率"},{"level":3,"text":"二级指标：跟踪质量","id":"二级指标-跟踪质量"},{"level":3,"text":"三级指标：流动性","id":"三级指标-流动性"},{"level":3,"text":"四级指标：税务效率","id":"四级指标-税务效率"},{"level":3,"text":"综合评分卡示例","id":"综合评分卡示例"},{"level":2,"text":"中国主流宽基 ETF 跟踪质量对比（2026 年数据）","id":"中国主流宽基-etf-跟踪质量对比-2026-年数据"},{"level":2,"text":"实践选基流程","id":"实践选基流程"},{"level":3,"text":"费率优先原则","id":"费率优先原则"},{"level":3,"text":"规模的门槛效应","id":"规模的门槛效应"},{"level":2,"text":"特殊场景：增强型指数基金","id":"特殊场景-增强型指数基金"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"市值加权与替代加权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/index-fund-theory/market-cap-weighting"},"next":{"title":"申购赎回机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/etf-mechanics/creation-redemption"}}